      "writtenOn": "2023-07-28T23:29:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can remove this, but just to confirm - the reason it\u0027s there is because I\u0027m silently ignoring a flag the user might have provided. Is it alright to drop in this case because they aren\u0027t supposed to be using RS anyways?",
      "parentUuid": "bab65cec_3d558f8f",
      "revId": "7e8dd804ba562385463e90e5c998beaf2f8c29d3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2e4aefbd_e1363615",
        "filename": "cc/rs.go",
