      "writtenOn": "2023-07-28T23:51:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It\u0027s not easy, I wouldn\u0027t recommend it in this case.  How many warnings do you get in the current build?  If there\u0027s no new RS APIs between N and current, what\u0027s the downside of ignoring the version the user set?  Maybe just put a TODO bug here to come back and fix them up later?",
      "parentUuid": "da18e321_1f5f9902",
      "revId": "7e8dd804ba562385463e90e5c998beaf2f8c29d3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
